ank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1005905","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[41,65,21,27,49,49],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1005905","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，韩德次子，武器为大刀。蜀国北伐期间，其父受命担任先锋阻拦诸葛亮，并先后派遣其四子单挑赵云，韩瑶出阵时欲直砍赵云，却被反手生擒。","tc":"魏國武將，韓德次子，武器為大刀。蜀國北伐期間，其父受命擔任先鋒阻攔諸葛亮，并先后派遣其四子單挑趙云，韓瑤出陣時欲直砍趙云，卻被反手生擒。","en":"An officer of Wei and the second son of Han De, whose weapon was a great saber. During Shu's Northern Expedition, his father was ordered to serve as vanguard to block Zhuge Liang, and sent his four sons out one after another to duel Zhao Yun. When Han Yao charged out intending to strike down Zhao Yun, he was instead captured alive by a deft counter-move.","jp":"魏の武将。韓徳の次男。武器は大刀。蜀の北伐の際、父の韓徳が先鋒として諸葛亮を阻む命を受け、4人の息子を次々と趙雲との一騎討ちに送り出した。韓瑶は出陣して趙雲に斬りかかろうとしたが、返り討ちに遭い生け捕りにされた。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 한덕의 차남으로, 무기로는 대도를 사용했다. 촉나라의 북벌 당시 부친이 선봉을 맡아 제갈량을 저지하라는 명을 받았으며, 네 아들을 차례로 내보내 조운과 일기토를 벌이게 했다. 한요는 출진하여 곧장 조운을 베어 넘기려 했으나, 오히려 역으로 생포당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10907","remark":"","surname":"韩","surnameTc":"韓","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"韓","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"瑶","nameTc":"瑤","nameEn":"Yao","nameJp":"瑶","nameKr":"요","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"韩瑶","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"224","city":"CS1013","gender":"0","rule":"41","force":"65","wise":"21","politics":"27","charm":"49","will":"49","ruleT